# Phase 18 Running Info nested DTO text API — 2026-10-18 17:48 UTC

- Branch: `phase/18-phase-18-compatibility-closure`.
- The invoked Java API inventory exposed explicit `toString()` overrides on
  `ProcessQueueInfo` and `PopProcessQueueInfo` that had no Rust text rendering.
  Added Rust `Display`/`ToString` implementations. `ProcessQueueInfo` uses
  Java's `UtilAll.timeMillisToHumanString` shape through the existing
  timezone-aware Java timestamp formatter; `PopProcessQueueInfo` preserves its
  Java labels, separators, and numeric timestamp. The Java fixture records
  both exact strings; the Protocol test compares them.
